{"t":"JNJ","made":"2026-11-11 10:29","name":"Johnson & Johnson","ko":"존슨앤드존슨","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - General","employees":138200,"hq":"New Brunswick, NJ, United States","website":"https://www.jnj.com","summary_en":"Johnson & Johnson, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the research and development, manufacture, and sale of a range of products in the healthcare field worldwide. It operates in two segments, Innovative Medicine and MedTech. The Innovative Medicine segment offers products for various therapeutic areas, such as oncology, immunology, neuroscience, pulmonary hypertension, infectious diseases, and cardiovascular and metabolism distributed through retailers, wholesalers, distributors, hospitals, and healthcare professionals for prescription use. The MedTech segment provides a portfolio of products used in the surgery, orthopedic, cardiovascular, and vision fields distributed through wholesalers, hospitals and retailers, and used in the professional fields by physicians, nurses, hospitals, eye care professionals and clinics. This segment also offers products and enabling technologies that support joint reconstruction, trauma, spine, sports related injuries, and others, as well as open, laparoscopic, and robotic surgical procedures; instrumentation, energy devices, stapling systems, wound closure, biosurgery products, and digital and robotic technologies; breast aesthetics and reconstruction; contact lenses under the ACUVUE brand; intraocular lenses for cataract surgery, and other products used in cataract and refractive procedures under the TECNIS brand. The company was founded in 1886 and is based in New Brunswick, New Jersey.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Johnson & Johnson은 자회사와 함께 전 세계 의료 분야의 다양한 제품에 대한 연구 개발, 제조 및 판매에 참여하고 있습니다. 혁신의학(Innovative Medicine)과 의료기술(MedTech)이라는 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 혁신 의학 부문은 종양학, 면역학, 신경과학, 폐고혈압, 전염병, 심혈관 및 대사 등 다양한 치료 분야에 대한 제품을 소매업체, 도매업체, 유통업체, 병원 및 의료 전문가를 통해 처방용으로 유통합니다. MedTech 부문은 도매업체, 병원 및 소매업체를 통해 유통되고 전문 분야에서는 의사, 간호사, 병원, 안과 전문의 및 진료소에서 사용되는 수술, 정형외과, 심혈관 및 안과 분야에서 사용되는 제품 포트폴리오를 제공합니다. 이 부문은 또한 관절 재건, 외상, 척추, 스포츠 관련 부상 등은 물론 개복, 복강경 및 로봇 수술 절차를 지원하는 제품과 기술을 제공합니다. 계측, 에너지 장치, 스테이플링 시스템, 상처 봉합, 생물외과 제품, 디지털 및 로봇 기술; 유방 미학 및 재건; ACUVUE 브랜드의 콘택트 렌즈; 백내장 수술용 안구내 렌즈, TECNIS 브랜드의 백내장 및 굴절 시술에 사용되는 기타 제품. 이 회사는 1886년에 설립되었으며 뉴저지 주 뉴브런즈윅에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":280.78,"mcap":675924606976.0,"pe":42.60698,"fpe":24.158522,"peg":3.1742,"ps":6.8044963,"pb":8.289932,"ev_ebitda":20.386,"div":1.9,"beta":0.2,"hi52":283.2502,"lo52":189.05},"fin":{"rev":99334995968.0,"rev_g":0.059,"eps_g":-0.959,"gross":0.67775,"op":0.25737,"net":0.16203,"roe":0.20018,"fcf":18501875712.0,"cash":17227999232.0,"debt":44650999808.0,"de":54.767,"eps":6.59,"feps":11.6224},"own":{"short":0.0078,"inst":0.76845,"insider":0.00054000004},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":279.4091,"median":280.5,"high":320.0,"low":190.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.91304,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":11,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":11,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":5,"buy":11,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":11,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":287.0,"priorPriceTarget":275.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":292.0,"priorPriceTarget":294.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-14","Firm":"Leerink Partners","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":272.0,"priorPriceTarget":276.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-14","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","price